""""".\DeploySolution.ps1""""" To run the script

There are two ways that we can use PAC 
1)Manual
2)Automate

1)Manual:
we need to run commands one by one and execute the process.

2)Automate:
We can run everything in a file. We can execute the file at once.
ex:
.\DeploySolution.ps1

File ex: 
        Write-Host "Starting deployment..."
          
          pac auth select --name DEV
          
          pac solution export `
              --name BudgetApproval `
              --path "C:\PowerPlatformSolutions\BudgetApproval.zip"
          
          pac auth select --name TEST
          
          pac solution import `
              --path "C:\PowerPlatformSolutions\BudgetApproval.zip"
    
    Write-Host "Deployment completed."
